! ForgeShare — private collaboration

Share a TiddlyWiki with family or collaborators through Tailscale. Run several wikis on one computer and choose them by name. The helper selects free ports and preserves existing services.

Open the control panel and choose the ''ForgeShare'' tab for setup, Mac/Windows/Linux helpers, safe sharing, sync and backup. If the tab is missing, enable the plugin, save and reload the wiki.

The language follows TiddlyWiki's own language selector: both ''Dansk (Danmark)'' and ''HUWiki Dansk'' display Danish. There is no additional selector. Other languages use the English guide.

''Test release.'' Importing the plugin starts no server, changes no access rules and installs no programs. Download and start the helper locally. Node.js and Tailscale must be installed. HTML/offline copies remain available.
